{"code": 0, "msg": "成功", "data": {"id": 69146, "game_id": 202, "entry_id": 49568, "uid": 55158, "type": 4, "title": "强化Ⅰ/Ⅱ区分", "tag": "0", "created_at": 1612716528, "updated_at": 1631090517, "updated_uid": 0, "comment_at": 1671792668, "last_at": 1671792668, "comment_count": 11, "status": 1, "summary": "4.18更新：此贴所述强化Ⅰ均指百分比强化Ⅰ。部分点火前天子拥有固定强化Ⅰ，如糖猫、独眼等，固定强化Ⅰ的计算公式可以参考这篇。说明：①TS/SS/Skill强化Ⅰ/Ⅱ在以往任何攻略中都简单的称为TS/", "thumb": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1617007870551_55004384.png", "model_ids": "", "like_count": 8, "unlike_count": 0, "view_count": 16586, "is_top": 0, "content_type": 0, "is_del": 0, "del_at": 0, "del_uid": 0, "is_release": 0, "source": 0, "last_ip_area": "", "is_prohibit_reply": 0, "is_only": 0, "state": 0, "audit_uid": 0, "favorite_count": 0, "seo": "", "video": "", "vote_ids": "", "is_elite": 0, "is_admin": 0, "audit_state": 0, "chat_game_id": 0, "is_image_text": 0, "from_chat": false, "chat_top": 0, "entry_auto": 1, "audit_at": 0, "server_id": 0, "image_num": 0, "video_list": "", "is_emulator": 0, "editor_type": 0, "ignore_hot": false, "mj_quote_num": 0, "mj_task_id": 0, "limit_age": 0, "important_at": 0, "is_expired": 0, "last_like_at": 0, "version": "", "word_count": 0, "content_id": 69146, "content": "<div></div><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><div></div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><div></div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><div></div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><div>4.18更新：此贴所述强化<span><span>Ⅰ均指百分比<span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; float: none;\">强化</span><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none;\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\">Ⅰ。部分点火前天子拥有固定<span><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; float: none;\">强化</span><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none;\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\">Ⅰ，如糖猫、独眼等，固定<span><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; float: none;\">强化</span><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none;\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\">Ⅰ的计算公式可以参考<a href=\"http://dc.gamekee.com/52136.html\" target=\"_blank\">这篇</a>。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div></div></span><div><span><span><span><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none;\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"><span><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none;\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"><span><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none;\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\"><br></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div>说明：</div><div>①<span><span style=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">TS/SS/Skill强化Ⅰ<span><span style=\"\">/Ⅱ在以往任何攻略中都简单的称为<span><span style=\"\"><span><span style=\"\">TS/SS/Skill伤害提升。<span><span style=\"\">之前并没有对<span><span style=\"\"><span><span style=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">强化Ⅰ<span><span style=\"\">/Ⅱ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>两种技能的区分的完整说明，希望看了此贴以后大家都有清晰的认知。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">②</span><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">所有强化Ⅰ都只对百分比技能生效，对非百分比技能看作不生效（收益极低）；所有强化Ⅱ对于百分比和非百分比技能都生效。主流的SS六连刀都是非百分比，而百分比刀全都是SS三连。</span></div><div><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">③所谓百分比技能，就是技能后面写了一个百分比，如暗弗雷的SS。</span></div><div><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">④Skill指的是TS和SS。Skill强化可以强化TS和SS，无法强化自动攻击和DS。LS指Leader Skill，就是队长技。</span></div><div><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">⑤TS强化、SS强化、Skill强化都是不同buff，当然可以叠加。Leader Skill可以和任何buff叠加。<br></span></div><div><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">⑥<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">为了方便统计，</span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;\">表中所有天子均为6红。</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">因为有些天子点火前是固定数值，点火后变为百分比，两者在伤害计算公式中的计算方式是不同的。如光糖猫点火前为ss伤害+1795，6红后变为ss伤害+60.3%。</span></div><div><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">⑦</span><span><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">强化Ⅰ和强化Ⅱ的技能图标相同，但是实为不同buff，可以叠加。</span></span></span><br></div><div><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">⑧区分方式如下：一般来说，描述中无最终两字的都是<span><span><span style=\"\"><span><span><span style=\"\">强化Ⅰ<span><span><span style=\"\"><span>，有最终两字的都是强化Ⅱ；也可点开技能图标查看。<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">注意，此条不适用于魂卡，凡是WB和Raid限定的、百分比增加伤害的魂卡，其实际效果，不论描述怎么写，既不是<span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;\">强化Ⅰ，也不是强化</span><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\">Ⅱ，写弱点最终伤害的也不是弱点最终伤害。具体见魂卡强度榜的说明。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">⑨LS太多就不整理了，自行根据第八条查看。需要注意的是，目前LS中，SS<span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; float: none;\">强化Ⅰ只有绚烂亚里亚，Skill<span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; float: none;\">强化Ⅱ只有绫音。</span></span></span></span></span><br></div><div><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span><span style=\"\"><span><span><span style=\"\"><span><span><span style=\"\">⑩看完以后你会发现策划很啥b，设计了一堆<span><span style=\"\"><span><span style=\"\">强化Ⅰ，这对主流的SS六连是不生效的；你还会发现，绚烂亚里亚的强力</span></span></span></span>很大程度上归功于自身的TS（<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">亚里亚2红ts才变2回合</span>）和LS，所以我不看好这个技能模板（LS除外）以外的所有百分比刀（水属性百分比刀除外，因为有水狙的存在）。已有的SS百分比刀中，弗雷、傻白、赛连都是菜鸡，除非点火后改成绚烂亚里亚的模板（LS除外）。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><br></div></span></span></span></span><div><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span><span style=\"\"><span><span><span style=\"\"><span><span><span style=\"\"><span><span style=\"\"><span><div class=\"div-img\"><span><div class=\"div-img\"><span><div class=\"div-img\"><span><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1617007870551_55004384.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1617007870551_55004384.png\"></div></span><br></div></span><br></div></span></div></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></span><div><br></div></span>", "content_json": "", "content_cdn": "", "is_favorite": 0, "is_like": 0, "is_unlike": 0, "thumb_list": ["//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1617007870551_55004384.png"], "model_list": [], "user": {"uid": 55158, "username": "Kyun", "avatar": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/avatar/1/12.png", "description": "", "follow_num": 194, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "", "tag_color": ""}, "role_id": 2, "is_super": false, "status": 1, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 0, "content_at": 99017156, "content_num": 1065, "read_num": 2013197, "like_num": 1043}, "update_user": {"uid": 0, "username": "", "avatar": "", "description": "", "follow_num": 0, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "", "tag_color": ""}, "role_id": 0, "is_super": fa